<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="E0505">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="1000D_S0004" variety="S0004">
<name>Lubrication</name>
<ttl id="1000D_S0004_72UWY_T000A" variety="T000A">
<name>Oil Pump Assembly (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000224I000X" category="A" type-id="8000D" name-id="130IQ-00" from="200511">
<name>Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM00000224I000X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM00000224I000X_01_0001" proc-id="E0505_____000005300000">
<ptxt>Inspect Oil Pump Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect Oil Pump Relief Valve</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Coat the oil pump relief valve with engine oil and check that it falls smoothly into the valve hole of the oil pump body by its own weight.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011419J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove Oil Pump Cover</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Remove the 5 bolts and remove the oil pump cover.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011431J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Side Clearance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using a precision straightedge and feeler gauge, inspect the side clearance.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011420J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<subtitle>Standard</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.030-0.085mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
<subtitle>Limit</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.16mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the clearance is more than the maximum, replace the oil pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Tip Clearance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using a feeler gauge, inspect the clearance between the drive rotor and driven rotor.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011421J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<subtitle>Standard</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.08-0.16mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
<subtitle>Limit</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.35mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the clearance is more than the maximum, replace the oil pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Body Clearance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using a feeler gauge, inspect the clearance between the driven rotor and the case.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011422J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<subtitle>Standard</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.10-0.17mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
<subtitle>Limit</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.325mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the clearance is more than the maximum, replace the oil pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove Oil Pump Rotor Set</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Remove the drive rotor and driven rotor from the oil pump cover.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A129352J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Install Oil Pump Rotor Set</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Apply engine oil to the drive rotor and driven rotor.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Assemble the rotors with the matchmarks facing the cover side.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A036759J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Install Oil Pump Cover</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Install the oil pump cover with the 5 bolts.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B011431J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<torque>
<torqueitem>
<t-value1>8.8</t-value1>
<t-value2>90</t-value2>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>